  "emptyBody": "kip to main content\nCHE\nDS\nInventory\nReorder suggestions\n\nCheras · Stock at or below its reorder level, with a suggested order. Nothing is ordered from this page.\n\nCheras\n\nEach row is one SKU at one location. A suggestion never places an order.\n\nHide helpful info\nHow it is worked out\n\nSuggested = reorder level − on hand − on order − incoming + 30-day average use × lead time, rounded up to whole packs and at least the supplier's minimum order. Where a maximum is set, the maximum is used instead of the reorder level.\n\nSold counts what was dispensed to patients from this location, OTC included. Treatment-room use is not a sale and is not counted. Medicine returned after dispensing is not taken off. The suggested quantity still uses the 30-day average of dispensing and treatment use, as before.\n\nEstimated costs are shown only to a Director or Finance Officer.\n\nSearch SKU, item or location\nShow\nOnly rows that need ordering\nAll low-stock rows\nSearch\n\nNo reorder suggestions match this search."
